  "ruleText": "Tax 102.03 “Agent” means a taxpayer's or condemnee's representative who is not an attorney.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.03); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14; ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
